Can you imagine trying to get to work, just have your car turn into an alien robot and fly away?

00:00:11.740 --> 00:00:13.900
Well, that's twenty-eight thousand dollars down the drain.

00:00:13.900 --> 00:00:16.840
Optimus, the least you can do is call 'em an Uber.

