00:01:26.240 --> 00:01:28.620
"MatPat, you've gone too far!

00:01:28.620 --> 00:01:30.600
Robotics have made advances in recent history,

00:01:30.600 --> 00:01:33.780
but the Transformers defy the laws of physics, you buttmunch."

